{"c":[{"name":"20260824T174900Z-adbb0c6c6a991bca","text":"equal_grain_pair is a fold-test oracle only; the copied driver does not keep it. fold_request still walks adjacent same-grain ViewNodes itself.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260824T174934Z-b3f3d92f255bc910","text":"summem checks sys.version_info immediately after import sys and before import tomllib; Python 3.10 prints SumMem needs Python 3.11 or newer instead of ModuleNotFoundError.","type":"note"}]}
